  "configuration_id": "config_007",
  "reason": "RNA-only singleprofile results show scvi_n200 outperforming pca_n2000 (accuracy 0.520 vs 0.485; F1 0.498 vs 0.464), but with only two RNA encoders tested the representation choice remains uncertain. config_007 tests scgpt with the same singleprofile setting and no aggregation or fusion, isolating the effect of RNA representation. This is the best next experiment because it completes a clean encoder comparison before adding profile, aggregation, image, or fusion complexity; if scgpt is stronger it changes future multimodal choices, and if not it confirms scvi as the RNA baseline and allows the next experiments to focus on profile/aggregation or image modality."
}

